cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CAPRI-mod
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it, and cite the original CAPRI
  model separately -- this is an independent reimplementation, not a
  release of the CAPRI modelling system.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted Python reimplementation of the economic logic of the
  CAPRI (Common Agricultural Policy Regionalised Impact) model, covering
  the regional PMP supply module, an Armington market module, CAP policy
  instruments, environmental, water and farm-income indicators, and a
  recursive-dynamic projection layer, calibrated against data extracted
  from CAPRI star-3.0 and validated against CAPRI's own outputs, the
  EcAMPA 2 abatement study and published JRC scenario results.
references:
  - type: software
    title: CAPRI modelling system
    notes: >-
      The original CAPRI model, developed at the University of Bonn and
      partner institutions. See https://www.capri-model.org
